OL,4,BNon-league player injured falling down 
OL,5,Bbadger hole                            
OL,6,GFootballers may be among the fittest   
OL,7,Gathletes in the world of sport, but    
OL,8,Gthey are not immune to bizarre         
OL,9,Ginjuries.                              
OL,11,FDave Beasant famously severed a tendon 
OL,12,Fin his big toe when he dropped a       
OL,13,Fbottle of salad cream, while Rio       
OL,14,FFerdinand strained tendons in his knee 
OL,15,Fby lying in one position on the sofa   
OL,16,Ffor too long watching television.      
OL,18,FThe latest inductee into the strange   
OL,19,Finjury hall of fame is Chelmsford City 
OL,20,Fcaptain Cav Miley.                     
